Z||000000||BAM-BAM||09-25-2000||06:19 PM||||  Just placed my order today with Mr. Mike for a set of seat covers, complete carpet kit/with floor mats and headliner. I ordered the 500 style seats in charcoal with dark grey inserts and bright red stitching on the logo, and speaker holes. Also ordered the complete carpet kit including the doors and firewall and mats. All in dark gey and the mats have FIERO GT stitchedd in bright red. Also ordered the new fiberglass headliner covered in dark grey with the sunroof and third brake light cut outs. This is totaly BANGIN. Grand total with shipping was $1056.71. Next comes the new windshield and door glass, dew strips. Not sure weather to die the door panels or get some in dark grey from the wreckers. I would have gone with the Mr.Mikes leathers, but it being a daily driver "AGAIN" I figured that wouldn't be very practical. Also getting a new sunroof seal. Man, am I excited!! WHOOOOOOOHOOOOOO!!!<BR> Ican hardly wait. Alright enough of my braggging, take care and I'll kepp everyone posted and even post some pics when it's all together.<P> Late, BAM OUT!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Don B. <BR>85GT||||reg||6
